  H, "May slightly reduce the chance of catching a cold. Doesn’t reliably shorten one you already have.",
  "A Cochrane review found echinacea products may slightly lower the risk of catching a cold, but don’t clearly shorten or ease colds once started. Products vary hugely in species, plant part and extraction, so results don’t carry from one brand to another.",
